    description: "YAML-driven taint source/sink/sanitizer catalog system extending IO primitive catalog pattern (ADR-0016). Built-in catalogs for crypto, filesystem, network. Project-local catalogs for custom domains. Taint labels: plaintext, crdt_content, key_material, ephemeral. Sanitizer transforms (e.g. plaintext→ciphertext). See ADR-0017 §2a-2c."  # f914
